{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **App Drawer:** Swipe up for every app in one A to Z list. Its search box also does quick sums, converts units and searches the web.\n- **A Tidier Home Screen:** Folders open on one page, and widgets show the time, weather, your music and your batteries (AirPods too).\n- **Your Look:** Icon shapes, icon themes and your own font, on the Home Screen or across all of iOS. Emoji stay Apple's.\n- **In Your Language:** Catapult follows your iPhone's language.\n- **Still Feels Like an iPhone:** Apps open and close with Apple's own animation, straight from their icon.\n\n[Everything it can do →](https://jond-ie.github.io/repo/catapult/)",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"markdown": "### How it works\n\n1. **Swipe up** for the app drawer: every app A to Z, with a letter bar to jump.\n2. **Long-press an empty spot** for Wallpaper & style (icon shapes, grid size), Widgets and Home settings.\n3. **Long-press an app** for its shortcuts, App info and Remove. Drag it onto another app to make a folder.\n4. **Type in the search bar:** apps, sums like `9+2`, conversions like `5 km in mi`, or a web search.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
